---
// Footer.astro - 1-Line Minimalist Mono Footer
---

<footer class="w-full border-t border-neutral-800/60 mt-16 bg-neutral-950/40">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500">
    <!-- Left: Copyright & Contact -->
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap justify-center sm:justify-start">
      <span>© 2026 CleanPhoto</span>
      <span class="text-neutral-700">•</span>
      <span>Built for <a href="https://cleanphoto.fixeehub.com" class="text-neutral-400 hover:text-white transition-colors">FixeeHub Ecosystem</a></span>
      <span class="text-neutral-700">•</span>
      <a href="mailto:contactfixeehub@gmail.com" class="text-neutral-400 hover:text-white transition-colors">
        contactfixeehub@gmail.com
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Right: Operational Status Indicator -->
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-neutral-400 font-mono">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 shadow-[0_0_8px_#10B981]"></span>
      <span>All Systems Operational</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
